  m_text: "<b>[GAMEPLAY] ATC Engine</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>Accuracy:</b> Fixed
    the hit percentage calculation.</indent>\n\n<b>[CORE & DATABASE] Database</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022
    <b>Game State:</b> Eliminated game state rebuilds; everything is now directly
    saved and restored after loading.</indent>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>Game Stats:</b>
    Saved games are now only applied to GameStats if the game has been fully finished.</indent>\n\n<b>[UI]
    Statistics</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>Precision:</b> Table values are now cleanly
    rounded to two decimal places.</indent>\n"
