  m_text: "<b>[FEATURE] Database</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>SQLite Migration:</b>
    Migrated the database from JSON to SQLite to achieve significant performance
    gains.</indent>\n\n<b>[FEATURE] StatisticsHandler</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>SQLite
    Transition:</b> Switched game history and player statistics over to SQLite storage.</indent>\n\n<b>[UI]
    Polish & Tweaks</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>Performance & Visuals:</b> Added several
    new animations and optimized the user interface for a smoother overall experience.</indent>\n\n<b>[FIX]
    Recorder</b>\n<indent=5%>\u2022 <b>Sound Normalization:</b> Fixed a bug in audio
    normalization to ensure volume levels are now adjusted correctly.</indent>\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
